412
00:35:47,771 --> 00:35:49,211
Genel kural şu.

413
00:35:49,872 --> 00:35:50,832
A maddesinin

414
00:35:51,184 --> 00:35:54,004
İkinci birleşik mertebesi M çarpı R.

415
