1343
01:17:04,399 --> 01:17:05,000
Arkadaşlar.

1344
01:17:05,659 --> 01:17:08,059
Mil potentlik derecesi de birdir sıfır matrisinin.

1345
01:17:09,659 --> 01:17:09,920
Evet.

1346
01:17:12,679 --> 01:17:13,519
A kare eşit

1347
01:17:13,519 --> 01:17:14,819
I oluyorsa

1348
01:17:14,819 --> 01:17:17,220
